      "type": "judge",
      "difficulty": 1,
      "stem": "若 $f$ 在 $x_0$ 处连续，则 $\\lim_{x\\to x_0}f(x)=f(x_0)$。",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "对"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "错"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": "这正是函数在一点连续的定义。",
      "page": 15,
      "kp": "c01"
    },
