      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "方程 $x^5+x-1=0$ 的实根个数为（ ）",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "$0$"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "$1$"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "$2$"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "$3$"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "$f'(x)=5x^4+1>0$，$f$ 严格递增，至多一个根；$f(0)=-1<0<f(1)=1$，至少一个根，所以恰有一个。",
      "page": 16,
      "kp": "c01"
    },
    {
      "id": "q008",
      "type": "fill",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin3x}{\\tan2x}=$（　）。",
      "options": [],
      "answer": [
        [
          "3/2",
